---
title: Sign a PDF with a .p12 / .pfx certificate
description: Add a PKCS#7 digital signature using your certificate — processed locally.
relatedTool: digital-sign-pdf
---

Add a PKCS#7 digital signature using your certificate — processed locally.

## Steps

1. Export your qualified certificate as `.p12` or `.pfx` (includes private key).
2. Open **Digital Sign PDF** on WeLovePDF.
3. Upload the PDF and your certificate file.
4. Enter the certificate password when prompted.
5. Download the signed PDF — the signature is embedded in the document.

## Notes

- Processing stays in your browser; the certificate is not uploaded to a server.
- Keep your `.p12` / `.pfx` password private.
